@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@functionKey =

### Configuration and local subscription count
GET {{baseUrl}}/engine/status
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

### Establish operations subscribers BEFORE approval or deliberate replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/engine/bootstrap
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

### Ingest sites (OWNER_ID registrations)
POST {{baseUrl}}/engine/ingest-sites
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

### Ingest approved segments; inspect failed/deferred and messagesAcknowledged
POST {{baseUrl}}/engine/ingest-segments
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

### Clear local handles only; does not reset data or delete subscriptions
POST {{baseUrl}}/engine/reset
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
